OL,3,GNEWSAWoman who died after crash 'will
OL,4,Abe deeply missed'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 19-year-old woman who died after a
OL,7,Fcar crashed into a tree will be "deeply
OL,8,Fmissed by all who had the privilege of
OL,9,Fknowing her", her family has said.
OL,11,FHarriet Boyles, from Stoke-on-Trent,
OL,12,Fwas a passenger in the Ford which
OL,13,Fcrashed on Lichfield Road in Armitage,
OL,14,FStaffordshire, at about 01:30 BST on 22
OL,15,FAugust.
OL,17,FShe was taken to hospital with serious
OL,18,Finjuries but died four days later,
OL,19,FStaffordshire Police said.
OL,23,APub: 02-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
