OL,3,GNEWSAWoman who died after crash 'will
OL,4,Abe deeply missed'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe vehicle's driver, a 23-year-old man
OL,7,Ffrom Newcastle-under-Lyme, was arrested
OL,8,Fon suspicion of driving offences and
OL,9,Fhas since been released on conditional
OL,10,Fbail.
